# config/local-paths.txt is deliberately TRACKED in this fork, not ignored.
# It declares pdf-config.mjs, which upstream does not ship. While it was
# ignored, CI checked out the repo without it, every declared path read as an
# orphan there, and validate-system-paths-coverage.mjs was red on all three
# platforms while passing locally — the exact loop upstream #2991 describes.
# v1.31.0 excludes the declaration file from the coverage manifest so a fork
# can commit it; do not re-add an ignore rule for it.
.manifesto-noted
